  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1503.16 Revisions to Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1503.16 Revisions to Applications.\n\n(a) Prior to the department reviewing a submitted application, the applicant may substitute a revised plan for the plan submitted with the application only if the revisions do not materially alter the scope or nature of the project.\n\n(b) If a revision proposed by the applicant materially alters the scope or nature of the project, the department shall deny the application.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; ss by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1500.html"
